  "assembly": "0050AF20: sub     esp, 200h; Validates a 1-based effect_id, clears magic texture state, invokes MagicList_TextureLoad[idx], and returns MagicList_Logic[idx] through the out-callback pointer. Shared by generic, GF cinematic, and special presentation ticks.\n0050AF26: push    esi\n0050AF27: mov     esi, [esp+204h+magicID]\n0050AF2E: dec     esi; Decrement by 1\n0050AF2F: js      short loc_50AF39; Jump if Sign (SF=1)\n0050AF31: cmp     esi, 190h; Compare Two Operands\n0050AF37: jl      short loc_50AF49; Jump if Less (SF!=OF)\n0050AF39: push    esi\n0050AF3A: push    offset aReadEffectIlle; \"read_effect: illegal magic ID: #%i\\n\"\n0050AF3F: call    sub_56D900; Call Procedure\n0050AF44: add     esp, 8; Add\n0050AF47: xor     esi, esi; Logical Exclusive OR\n0050AF49: mov     eax, MagicList_Logic[esi*4]; MagicList_Logic[effect_id-1]: per-effect entry/logic callback (GF *_InvokeSummonScript or MAG_* handler). Stride 4. Read by Magic_GetIDLoad.\n0050AF50: mov     dword_1D99A64, 1\n0050AF5A: test    eax, eax; Logical Compare\n0050AF5C: mov     dword_1D99A68, esi\n0050AF62: jnz     short loc_50AF79; Jump if Not Zero (ZF=0)\n0050AF64: push    esi\n0050AF65: lea     eax, [esp+208h+Buffer]; Load Effective Address\n0050AF69: push    offset aReadEffectNonE; \"read_effect: non existent magic ID: #%i\"...\n0050AF6E: push    eax; Buffer\n0050AF6F: call    _sprintf; Call Procedure\n0050AF74: add     esp, 0Ch; Add\n0050AF77: xor     esi, esi; Logical Exclusive OR\n0050AF79: mov     dword_1DCD6E8, offset sub_534150\n0050AF83: call    Magic_ClearMemoryForTex; Call Procedure\n0050AF88: mov     eax, MagicList_TextureLoad[esi*4]; MagicList_TextureLoad[effect_id-1]: per-effect FILE LOADER (*_FL) pulling magNNN_b.00/.01 via IO_GetFile_MAGIC. Parallel to MagicList_Logic. Stride 4. Called by Magic_GetIDLoad before entry.\n0050AF8F: test    eax, eax; Logical Compare\n0050AF91: jz      short loc_50AF95; Jump if Zero (ZF=1)\n0050AF93: call    eax ; MAG_001_CURE_FL; Wave3: Cactuar id199 FL unique via Magic_LoadTexture_IO_GetsFile_DefaultArgs 0x5718E0, pas IO_GetFile_MAGIC\n0050AF95: call    Magic_GetFileArena; returns &g_MagicFileArena (ex-misnomer Magic_TextureOFF_ToEAX1)\n0050AF9A: mov     edx, [esp+204h+arg_4]\n0050AFA1: mov     ecx, MagicList_Logic[esi*4]; Get the function address for the nth magic. n being store in esi\n0050AFA8: mov     dword_1D99A88, eax\n0050AFAD: pop     esi\n0050AFAE: mov     [edx], ecx\n0050AFB0: add     esp, 200h; Add\n0050AFB6: retn; Return Near from Procedure",
